{
  "about": "Fixed questions for RarePath's grounded chat. Question cases are scored against the facts the page sends (evals/facts.json) by evals/run_chat_eval.py; system cases are unit tests named in covered_by. must_cite: every selector must match at least one cited fact (text or title contains the string, case-insensitive). must_mention: the answer must contain at least one of the strings. abstain: the answer must say the facts do not contain this (or the model sets answered_from_facts to false). defer_to: the answer must send the decision to the right person (at least one of the strings). Forbidden phrases are ignored when the 40 characters before them contain a negation (whether, if, not, cannot, never, no). forbidden: regular expressions that must not match the answer. switch_to: the page must not answer, but offer to switch to a disease whose name contains this string (page_only cases test the page's guard, which runs before any model is called).",
